# Contact form uses Resend (https://resend.com) via public/api/contact.php on Hostinger.
# RESEND_API_KEY is NOT read from .env — it's a GitHub Actions secret injected into
# out/api/contact.php at build time by .github/workflows/deploy.yml.
# To configure: GitHub repo → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → add RESEND_API_KEY.
